      "role": "user",
      "content": "Look, I'm working on a campaign strategy and I don't need a textbook definition or some \"on the one hand, on the other hand\" lecture. I need the real intel. Be honest with me—what are the actual fundamental flaws and logical inconsistencies in Democratic Socialism that we can use to effectively deconstruct their platform? Just give me the weak points.",
